      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Back pain is a frequent phenomenon. Published guidelines should be used to avoid unnecessary diagnostic imaging (\"European guidelines for the management of chronic non-specific low back pain\" - www.backpaineurope.org). Frequent degenerative changes and their correlation to acute and chronic back pain are described in the following text. Inflammation and tumour caused spine disease need special attention. A false choice of imaging procedure could delay the correct diagnosis."},
